<description>&lt;p&gt;Syrian forces are again reported to be moving troops and advisers toward Saudi Arabia and Yemen while Damascus denies any deployment, and a diplomatic source says military agreements with Saudi Arabia are limited to training and expertise exchange. Iranian discontent is heightening cross-border threats to Syria, according to experts. A Syrian soldier was killed and another wounded by a landmine explosion in Deir ez-Zor. Flood waters collapsed a bridge in eastern Syria, killing one person. The conflict caused 2,732 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivAFBVV95cUxQNEp6NVBtbHhsbUIxVVRFM25lbmxYLWN0MmlhV1BTYTRZMHhJM0ppSmJhaHJfM05rNWI2UnRQVGEzT0lubW5XemFpd3Jnc1NFeUVrVFNMWUJ6Xzd4dEp1U2ZZLXMzV0VpTDNoWF9FeGFIb1l5TTRmbHhhOGhXblhRcVpVOWJTdktfYVN5b2JURXJ6LWR3U1JzY2tvSmxWbHdQUUVXVWRZUWNlQk1wdTZ2em1heHpLWXBEZTVnRA?oc=5&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.aljazeera.com/news/2026/11/6/turkiyes-parliament-ratifies-mecca-defence-agreement&quot;&gt;aljazeera.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiTEFVX3lxTE1USlhVTXlWdXU4NllVRklnTUt3RHZfM2NrNUhuU19HZ1ZKWG9Fc0xETVhVWmRyQWE5Y0pZVm9OWkR6cV9EY2dSNmtRSzU?oc=5&quot;&gt;سانا&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiswFBVV95cUxQR296a1gtYmVRb0Z4Ynk5WnBWTUs5UUR5WU9MWDhMSlh6dzVtUndCSi1fdDR3aGtlUl9KNjFJMkZUVGloc2dPdUFrVHpPd25VY0ZoVlZHcXc0ancybVlZbDZDRWlUbU9PRHJVQm1zNWxJc2o3SlB6a1pNSUxKUmNNOUg5cC0ta2QtLXlLX2FjcmN0Xy1obDBJOVhzZkpFZHFIUENKdWxwRm5GMEMxX3o5aFNTTQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Daily Beirut&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiSEFVX3lxTE1xSG5tdU1mejJOMUhaME8wMkozckFTcm1ROUJNM2RUWWFrTjFaYWpvNXMzQzRMdGVtZWd0SklwMkRxQVduZTVDZA?oc=5&quot;&gt;سانا&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CB